{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39996","headline":"谢主人惠绿酒白鱼 · 徐夤","name":"谢主人惠绿酒白鱼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早起雀声送喜频，白鱼芳酒寄来珍。\n馨香乍揭春风瓮，拨刺初辞夜雨津。\n樽阔最宜澄桂液，网疎殊未损霜鳞。\n不曾垂钓兼亲酝，堪愧金台醉饱身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39996.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39996","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}